---
name: Normalize Live Claude Code OTLP
description: >
  Receives Claude Code logs and spans over OTLP/HTTP and maps them to OCSF,
  including Base Event fallbacks. Metrics are excluded.
---

accept_otlp "0.0.0.0:4318", transport="http", schema="record"
where @name in ["otel.log", "otel.span"]
anthropic::claude_code::ocsf::normalize
